OL,3,GNEWSASpeedway world champions heading
OL,4,Ato Ipswich stadium
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British speedway club is preparing to
OL,7,Fshow off "the best riders in the world"
OL,8,Fafter it was selected to host the FIM
OL,9,FSpeedway World Championships.
OL,11,FIpswich Witches said it would be the
OL,12,F"biggest event in the club's 75-year
OL,13,Fhistory" when the racing takes place at
OL,14,FFoxhall Stadium on 13 and 14 August
OL,15,Fnext year.
OL,17,FRichard Coleman, the club's chairman,
OL,18,Fsaid he hoped it would "help the club
OL,19,Fkick onto the next era" after it won
OL,20,Fthe league in 2025.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
