OL,3,GNEWSASpeedway world champions heading
OL,4,Ato Ipswich stadium
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This gives us an opportunity to make
OL,7,Finvestments that will be very hard to
OL,8,Fjustify if it was just looking at the
OL,9,Fleague club in isolation," he said.
